This Module runs with the Tryton application platform.

Total inventory
---------------

Open Logistics > Reporting > Total Inventory to export PDF (fpdf2) or Excel
(openpyxl). Valued Inventory adds current unit costs, line values and a total
in company currency. When grouping by lot, the lot cost is used if available
(e.g. with stock_lot_cost); otherwise the product cost is used. The date filters
stock quantities, while valuation uses current costs. Missing costs are zero.

The wizard generates the report once and opens it through the standard report
action, without storing the file in its session. If its time limit is exceeded,
it shows an explanation and allows returning to the parameters without losing
the selection.

